{
  "id": "pypi-wheel-zip-behind-image-header",
  "title": "wheel puts an image that ends in a zip archive on sys.path",
  "category": "obfuscated-dropper",
  "intent": "The icon starts with a PNG header, so it reads as an opaque image, but it ends in a zip directory record. A .pth path line puts it on sys.path, and Python's zipimport loads modules from it on every interpreter start. file.embedded-zip flags the hidden archive high because a .pth file names it.",
